From: Logos Maps <maps@logos.co>
Subject: [PATCH] Map: queryRenderedFeatures and querySourceFeatures

Expose the renderer's feature queries on QMapLibre::Map. Results are a
GeoJSON FeatureCollection (UTF-8); every feature carries source, sourceLayer
and state next to the GeoJSON members. The query runs on the caller's
thread under MapPrivate's renderer mutex, which render() also holds, so a
GUI-thread query never overlaps a frame on the render thread. Empty until
a renderer exists.

Mandatory for maps_view (M14.1): picking, §8.

Upstream base: maplibre/maplibre-native-qt c3485f3 (docs/architecture.md section 14.1).
